	(text "Dual Input Pressure Transducer / General Purpose ADC to 3.3V SPI board.\nIn single ended mode, up to 2 inputs can be connected.\nIn differential mode, SIN1 and SIN2 form a full differential input.\nInput voltage is 12V. SPI digital voltage is 3.3V. Pressure Transducer Power OUT is 5V.\nAll mounting holes are M2.5. See PCB layout for dimensions and hole placements."
